     {
      "url": "https://www.parliament.vic.gov.au/4ab412/globalassets/tabled-paper-documents/tabled-paper-10742/parkville-youth-mental-health-and-wellbeing-service-annual-report-2025-26.pdf",
      "document": "annual report",
      "page": 7
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "The service reported removing the two-year care limit for existing patients and new referrals in September 2025.",
    "cites": [
     {
      "url": "https://www.parliament.vic.gov.au/4ab412/globalassets/tabled-paper-documents/tabled-paper-10742/parkville-youth-mental-health-and-wellbeing-service-annual-report-2025-26.pdf",
      "document": "annual report",
      "page": 13
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "It reported relocating its inpatient unit to Footscray Hospital and its access and home treatment teams to Spotswood in February 2026.",
    "cites": [
     {
      "url": "https://www.parliament.vic.gov.au/4ab412/globalassets/tabled-paper-documents/tabled-paper-10742/parkville-youth-mental-health-and-wellbeing-service-annual-report-2025-26.pdf",
      "document": "annual report",
      "page": 13
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "It reported that clinical activity grew more gradually than planned while services were being established and transferred.",
